  "title": "Flexible MXene/Carbon Nanotube Composite Paper with High Volumetric Capacitance",
  "abstract": "Free-standing and flexible sandwich-like MXene/carbon nanotube (CNT) paper, composed of alternating MXene and CNT layers, is fabricated using a simple filtration method. These sandwich-like papers exhibit high volumetric capacitances, good rate performances, and excellent cycling stability when employed as electrodes in supercapacitors.",
